  "body": "Time to Upgrade Your Life? Stop Right Here—You’ve Found Your Dream Home!\r\n\r\nWelcome to 10 Wira Lane, Silverdale – where style shakes hands with comfort, and every day feels like a celebration. Your future will begin here.\r\n\r\nWhy You’ll Fall in Love:\r\n\r\n• Brand New, Move-In Ready: Just unpack, relax, and start making memories from day one! No renos, no worries!\r\n• Room for Everyone: 4 generous bedrooms, 2 spacious living areas, and 3 sparkling bathrooms, including a luxe master ensuite with a walk-in wardrobe.\r\n• Effortless Entertaining: Open-plan living and dining, plus a separate family room (that can be used as a 5th bedroom). Flow seamlessly onto your deck and easy-care garden —the perfect spot for BBQs, parties, or a quiet glass of wine after a long day.\r\n• Comfort All Year Round: Central air conditioning means you’re cozy in winter and cool as a cucumber in summer. Comfort is always in season here!\r\n• Chef’s Kitchen Goals: Whip up gourmet feasts with quality appliances and gas cooking. MasterChef dreams, meet your match.\r\n• Low-Maintenance, Freehold Section: More time for the things you love.\r\n\r\nLocation, Location, Location—It Doesn’t Get Better Than This!\r\n\r\n• Stroll to Hibiscus Coast Station, Park & Ride, McDonald’s, PAK’nSAVE and handy local shops.\r\n• 2-minute dash to the motorway—your easy commute starts here!\r\n• Close to top schools, cafes, shopping centres, restaurants, parks, and the sparkling Hibiscus Coast beaches.\r\n\r\nDon’t Miss Out—This Silverdale Sanctuary Won’t Last!\r\n• Our vendor is highly motivated, and all serious offers are welcome. Opportunities like this don’t come knocking every day. Bring your family, bring your dreams, and let’s make this incredible home your next chapter.\r\n\r\nReady to see it for yourself? Call me today—before someone else claims your slice of Silverdale paradise!\r\n\r\nDirections to your future home:\r\n• Exit the motorway onto Twin Coast Discovery Highway, continue to the second traffic light and turn right onto Painton Rd. At the roundabout, turn left onto Goldwater Dr. Take the second left onto Tack Rd, and you’ll find 10 Wira Lane on your right.",
